earth: a quiet week at {aim.place}, and {aim.person} offers a corner of it to try {aim2.thing} in
tribal: a still day at the camp, and {aim.person} offers {N} the afternoon to try {aim2.doing} with {aim.doing}
magic: an idle day in the tower, and {aim.person} offers a room to try {aim2.thing} beside {aim.thing}
scene: It is a quiet week at {aim.place}, and {aim.person} offers {N} a corner of the weekend to try something new with a few willing people. {N} has wondered for a while what {aim.doing} would look like with {aim2.thing} in it. Nothing rides on it, and the offer is only for this week.
scene tribal: The camp is still for a day while the hunters rest, and {aim.person} offers {N} the afternoon and a few willing hands. {N} has long wondered what {aim.doing} would be with {aim2.doing} in it.
scene magic: The tower is idle for a day, and {aim.person} offers {N} an empty room and a few curious pupils. {N} has long wondered what {aim.thing} would become with {aim2.thing} worked into it.
- W | decline politely, as the weekend is already promised to others | v: conformity, benevolence | aim: skip | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 92
- U | accept, and run it as a small, careful test with notes | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: try | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 72
- B | accept, and invite one person whose good opinion matters | v: power, achievement | aim: try | foot: person patron | chance: 62
- R | let the day go, as the idea is more fun as a daydream for now | v: hedonism, stimulation | aim: skip | foot: lesson some ideas like waiting | chance: 92
- G | accept, and keep it small and homely with familiar faces | v: tradition, benevolence | aim: try | foot: person friend | chance: 76
- W>U | accept, and set out the session step by step beforehand | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: try | foot: person colleague | chance: 72
- U>B | accept, and use the trial to find what could later be offered properly | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: try | foot: place gather.hall | chance: 66
- B>R | accept, and make the trial lively enough that word gets round | v: power, stimulation | aim: try | foot: person regular | chance: 60
- R>G | spend the free day outdoors with friends instead | v: hedonism, benevolence | aim: skip | foot: lesson rest feeds the next idea | chance: 92
- G>W | accept, and ask {aim.person} to stay and help keep it on track | v: benevolence, conformity | aim: try | foot: person mentor | chance: 74
works not W R R>G: The few who came leave talking, and one of them asks when the next one is. {aim.person} offers {N} a regular slot.
works: Whatever {N} did with the day, the idea is still there, a little clearer than before.
fails not W R R>G: The trial is awkward and half the room is lost, and {N} sees which part needs explaining first.
fails: The quiet week ends, and a chance like it does not come back soon.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- integrate: an opening that asks for both (cycle B)

== the opening that asks for both
tier: life event
shape: any
kind: integrate
rungs: 2 3 4
fork:
stages: juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 16-90
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: mixed
life: work, learning
horizon: months
roles: patron, mentor, boss, colleague
earth: an opening somewhere asks for someone who can show {aim.thing} and {aim2.thing} working together
tribal: a neighbouring clan asks for one who can show {aim.doing} and {aim2.doing} joined, for a season among them
magic: a post at court for one who can show {aim.thing} and {aim2.thing} worked as one
scene: {aim.person} passes on a notice: an opening somewhere that asks, unusually, for someone who can show {aim.thing} and {aim2.thing} working together. Knowing both is not enough: the application wants one worked example, and it closes in a month.
scene tribal: A neighbouring clan has sent word through {aim.person}: they want one who can show {aim.doing} and {aim2.doing} joined, to stay a season among them. They will judge by what is shown at the next gathering, a moon from now.
scene magic: A post has opened at court for one who can show {aim.thing} and {aim2.thing} worked as one. The steward wants a demonstration, not a list of honours, by the month's end.
- W | apply by the book, with the worked example done exactly to the brief | v: conformity, achievement | aim: try | foot: person boss | chance: 58
- U | hold off, as one worked example is not yet enough to judge the fit | v: self-direction, security | aim: skip | foot: lesson know the fit first | chance: 88
- B | let this one pass, since a better-placed opening will come on {Ns} terms | v: power, achievement | aim: skip | foot: door turned down a chance | chance: 90
- R | apply on impulse, with the wildest worked example {N} can imagine | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: try | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 50
- G | apply, with an example drawn from {Ns} own everyday round | v: benevolence, tradition | aim: try | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 64
- W>B | apply, and ask {aim.person} for a letter to go with it | v: conformity, power | aim: try | foot: person patron | chance: 60
- B>G | apply, and make the example about the town that raised {N} | v: achievement, tradition | aim: try | foot: person elder | chance: 58
- G>U | leave it, and spend the year learning how the two truly fit | v: security, self-direction | aim: skip | foot: lesson the fit takes years | chance: 90
- U>R | apply with an example built on an experiment nobody has tried | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: try | foot: place learn.keeping | chance: 54
- R>W | apply as a pair, with a friend who knows {aim2.thing} well | v: stimulation, conformity | aim: try | foot: person friend | chance: 56
works not U B G>U: The worked example is what they remember. {N} is invited to meet the people behind the opening, and a new door stands open.
works: Whatever {N} decided, {aim.person} keeps {Ns} name in mind for the next one.
fails not U B G>U: Someone else's example is sharper this time, and {N} comes away knowing what the joining still lacks.
fails: The month passes quickly, and the notice comes down before {N} feels sure of anything.
